476
00:35:35.842 --> 00:35:37.302
ABOGADO
KIM SANGRAK

477
00:35:37.385 --> 00:35:38.511
ABOGADO
KIM SANGRAK

478
00:35:39.638 --> 00:35:40.805
Ako ay isang tagapagtanggol ng publiko.

479
00:35:41.681 --> 00:35:43.725
Hindi ako isang hotshot na abogado.

480
00:35:43.808 --> 00:35:45.602
Sabi niya walang ebidensya.

481
00:35:46.269 --> 00:35:47.270
Walang record nito.

482
00:35:52.108 --> 00:35:53.151
That fucking bastard.

483
00:35:53.234 --> 00:35:55.403
Sigurado akong isa siya sa kanila.
Alam kong siya iyon.

484
00:35:56.863 --> 00:35:58.948
Oh, at para lamang maging ligtas,

485
